*> vybe-test: cobol/conditions/test_condition_sign
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_conditions.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-POS PIC S9(3) VALUE 10.
01 WS-NEG PIC S9(3) VALUE -10.
01 WS-ZER PIC S9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF WS-POS IS POSITIVE
        DISPLAY "POS"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "POS" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "POS"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [POS] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    IF WS-NEG IS NEGATIVE
        DISPLAY "NEG"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "NEG" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "NEG"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [NEG] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    IF WS-ZER IS ZERO
        DISPLAY "ZER"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "ZER" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ZER"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ZER] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

